    "roi_pct"
  ],
  "promotion_policy": "No automatic prompt promotion in v1. v3.0 is the initial prospective baseline and v3.1 is the initial shadow candidate. Grade A paired evidence is reported after the minimum shared-case threshold is met. ROI must never be the sole promotion criterion."
